# =============================================================================
# Personal Finance Monthly Reporting Engine — .gitignore
# Strategy: ALLOWLIST. Everything at the repository root is ignored by default;
# only explicitly listed code/documentation is versioned. New data files are
# therefore excluded automatically (SECURITY > CONVENIENCE).
# =============================================================================

# 1) Deny everything at the root by default
/*

# 2) Allow code, configuration templates and documentation (explicit list)
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.env.example
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/engine.py
!/rlib.py
!/charts.py
!/powerbi_rest_client.py
!/dax_queries.md
!/pipeline/
!/docs/
!/examples/
!/scripts/
!/.claude/

# 3) Never version JSON by default (results may contain financial data).
#    Only sanitized examples and the Claude Code project settings are allowed.
*.json
!/examples/*.example.json
!/.claude/settings.json

# 4) Secrets and local configuration — never
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
.azure/
.claude/settings.local.json

# 5) Personal financial data and exports — never (even inside allowed folders)
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.pbix
*.pbit
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.zip
*.skill
*.md.bak

# 6) Generated artefacts and run outputs — never
work/
regression/
output/
outputs/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.log
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# 7) OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
~$*
.vscode/
.idea/
